# =========================
# UNITY ÇEKİRDEK KLASÖRLERİ
# =========================
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Uu]serSettings/
